Mostly that depends on how much longer you stayed on
the level or how long you have to be on it looking
for the "oY when you return.

Monster-move-time only passes while you're on the
level, so if you dropped the "oY by a stairs and
then changed level, almost certainly you'll find it
where you dropped it. If you dropped it and then
trudged across the level either leaving or
returning, bets are very much off that it is where
you left it.

Anything including a pet might have moved it.

